# Internal working documents — local reference only, never deployed.
# The release audits enumerate known weaknesses of a live payments site and
# must not be published; the dated filenames do not match the RELEASE_AUDIT.md
# rule above, so they are matched explicitly here.
docs/RELEASE_AUDIT*.md
docs/IMAGE_CREDITS.md
docs/CHANGE-TRACKER.md

# Unused 2.4 MB source PNG. Only the 157 KB .webp is referenced (QuoteBanner,
# o-mnie). Kept locally as the master; excluded so it never enters git history.
public/images/twilight-glow-enchanted-forest.png

# Supabase schema migrations. Deliberately NOT published: this repository is
# public, and the migrations describe the exact table, column and RLS layout of
# a live payments database. They are applied through the Supabase dashboard and
# kept locally only.
supabase/